            "id": "https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/43568",
            "content_html": "<h3 dir=\"auto\">MDN URL</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Element/input_event\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Element/input_event</a></p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">What specific section or headline is this issue about?</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><em>No response</em></p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">What information was incorrect, unhelpful, or incomplete?</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Element/input_event\" rel=\"nofollow\">Element: input event</a> page has the following breadcrumbs:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web\" rel=\"nofollow\">Web</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API\" rel=\"nofollow\">Web APIs</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Element\" rel=\"nofollow\">Element</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Element/input_event\" rel=\"nofollow\">input</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This confused me a bit, because <code class=\"notranslate\">input</code> is also <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Reference/Elements/input\" rel=\"nofollow\">an HTML <em>element</em></a>, which has the following breadcrumbs:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web\" rel=\"nofollow\">Web</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML\" rel=\"nofollow\">HTML</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Reference\" rel=\"nofollow\">Reference</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Reference/Elements\" rel=\"nofollow\">Elements</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Reference/Elements/input\" rel=\"nofollow\">&lt;input&gt;</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">What did you expect to see?</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">I would expect the breadcrumb leaf for the event page to has an indicator, such as \"input event\" or \"input (event)\".</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Do you have any supporting links, references, or citations?</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><em>No response</em></p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Do you have anything more you want to share?</h3>\n<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/495429/568506780-11ec2595-308d-4a1a-9a0b-56fe1ae2d9c2.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJnaXRodWIuY29tIiwiYXVkIjoicmF3LmdpdGh1YnVzZXJjb250ZW50LmNvbSIsImtleSI6ImtleTUiLCJleHAiOjE3OTA1MTQyNDEsIm5iZiI6MTc5MDUxMzk0MSwicGF0aCI6Ii80OTU0MjkvNTY4NTA2NzgwLTExZWMyNTk1LTMwOGQtNGExYS05YTBiLTU2ZmUxYWUyZDljMi5wbmc_.yg5jFgbQN_vJKo0sB3dRs8fqoeU5zOFqkhdD47CLjso\"><img width=\"898\" height=\"85\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/495429/568506780-11ec2595-308d-4a1a-9a0b-56fe1ae2d9c2.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJnaXRodWIuY29tIiwiYXVkIjoicmF3LmdpdGh1YnVzZXJjb250ZW50LmNvbSIsImtleSI6ImtleTUiLCJleHAiOjE3OTA1MTQyNDEsIm5iZiI6MTc5MDUxMzk0MSwicGF0aCI6Ii80OTU0MjkvNTY4NTA2NzgwLTExZWMyNTk1LTMwOGQtNGExYS05YTBiLTU2ZmUxYWUyZDljMi5wbmc_.yg5jFgbQN_vJKo0sB3dRs8fqoeU5zOFqkhdD47CLjso\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 85px;; aspect-ratio: 898 / 85; background-color: var(--bgColor-muted); border-radius: 6px\" class=\"js-gh-image-fallback\"></a>",
